      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Not sure if you are aware, but removing friends does not influence your rank. Getting blocked, muted, kicked and so on, that does have a negative impact. However please note that in order to rank up, adding friends is just one of the many ways to do so. Simply playing, joining, getting joined on, uploading avatars/words, or just playing the game overall are just as viable to get you to a higher rank. It took me a while to get my rank, be patient, and you will get it eventually. After all, its just a rank, just enjoy the game, and make good friends/memories ;)",
