  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Maybe change it to where if you remove friends from your friends list it doesn’t effect your rank. Because there are a lot of people who don’t get on or who I don’t ever talk to and as someone who likes to keep things nice and clean it’s annoying to have over 200 people I don’t talk to on my friends list. I would like to rank up but if that’s how it’s gonna be then I don’t wanna put in the effort to play this game.",
